                                                "sense_id": "d55caa6b-4326-3872-ba39-0e553111a97a",
                                                "text": "O queen Emilia, / Fresher than May, sweeter / Than her gold buttons on the boughs,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db456a09-5c98-3d7e-9920-52af757263a5",
